{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1763666233\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: Botanical Investigator. Change the seasons, investigate plants, and solve a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Understand the world's secrets to piece together clues and solve an environmental disaster. Meet wacky characters and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between three strange seasons to investigate clues. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE WEB to connect the dots and unearth a conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1763666233\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1763666233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1763666233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Strange Seasons</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and YOUR BOSS, WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073330?t=1763666233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073330?t=1763666233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763666233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763666233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1763666233\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: Botanical Investigator. Change the seasons, investigate plants, and solve a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Understand the world's secrets to piece together clues and solve an environmental disaster. Meet wacky characters and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between three strange seasons to investigate clues. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE WEB to connect the dots and unearth a conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1763666233\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1763666233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1763666233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Strange Seasons</h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and YOUR BOSS, WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Michael Mato"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/header.jpg?t=1763666233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2073330/2013404964/1b9601742312312f8e3ad93981ac2fc8152af13a/1763639958/dash_av1.mpd?t=